-Sure.

00:17:50.027 --> 00:17:50.944
You're having more?

00:17:51.028 --> 00:17:52.529
Huh? Why not?

00:17:52.613 --> 00:17:55.991
It's been ages since
I've had such good news. I'm celebrating.

00:17:56.075 --> 00:17:57.326
