00:20:00.616 --> 00:20:06.747
Plastic surgery! Plastic surgery!
Plastic surgery! Plastic surgery!

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:09.917
Plastic surgery!
Plastic surgery! Plastic surgery!

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:13.295
Plastic surgery!
Plastic surgery! Plastic surgery!

