00:27:39.991 --> 00:27:41.993
Mm, this is delicious.

00:27:42.077 --> 00:27:43.119
-You like it?
-Mm.

00:27:43.203 --> 00:27:45.121
Good.

00:27:45.205 --> 00:27:46.956
