00:31:47.071 --> 00:31:48.448
Just please

00:31:49.574 --> 00:31:50.617
make her quit.

00:31:55.163 --> 00:31:56.247
Uh…

00:31:57.373 --> 00:31:58.875
I don't understand.

00:31:58.958 --> 00:32:01.210
Why exactly do you want her
to quit so much?

00:32:02.629 --> 00:32:05.006
Well, because I'm her mom,

00:32:05.089 --> 00:32:06.090
obviously,

00:32:06.174 --> 00:32:09.010
and she's my daughter.

00:32:09.719 --> 00:32:11.304
And I want to protect her

00:32:12.180 --> 00:32:13.973
from all you people.

00:32:15.642 --> 00:32:16.893
A medical accident?

00:32:20.271 --> 00:32:22.440
You saw the Konoike girl, right?

00:32:25.193 --> 00:32:28.529
She went blind
because of a mistake during a procedure.

00:32:34.786 --> 00:32:37.455
The director performed the surgery.

00:32:39.916 --> 00:32:42.543
It was a complicated procedure.

00:32:42.627 --> 00:32:47.757
A combination of submental liposuction
and midface fat grafting.

00:32:58.726 --> 00:33:00.144
Ms. Konoike.

00:33:02.397 --> 00:33:04.190
-Ms. Konoike!
-Should we call the doctor?

00:33:04.273 --> 00:33:07.068
-Yes.
-Ms. Konoike, can you hear me?

00:33:08.778 --> 00:33:11.406
-Doctor.
-She's still unconscious?

00:33:11.489 --> 00:33:13.574
We might need an ambulance.
She's not waking up.

00:33:14.867 --> 00:33:15.743
Sara, hon?

00:33:16.953 --> 00:33:19.539
Sara, can you hear me? Sara, wake up.

00:33:20.623 --> 00:33:21.499
Sara!

00:33:30.049 --> 00:33:32.844
She seems all right. Thank goodness.

00:33:32.927 --> 00:33:34.178
Sara,

00:33:34.679 --> 00:33:36.222
how are you feeling?

00:33:40.309 --> 00:33:41.352
My eyes.

00:33:42.812 --> 00:33:44.188
What about your eyes?

00:33:47.567 --> 00:33:48.568
Why can't I see?

00:33:51.863 --> 00:33:53.072
I can't see.

00:33:56.993 --> 00:33:58.536
Why can't I see?

00:33:59.120 --> 00:34:02.415
Her grandfather
has been a patron of the Tohyama Clinic

00:34:02.498 --> 00:34:05.918
ever since the former director,
Chairman Tohyama, founded it.

00:34:07.587 --> 00:34:08.921
The director was responsible

00:34:09.005 --> 00:34:12.008
for an extremely important person's
granddaughter going blind.

00:34:12.633 --> 00:34:14.552
And that's when she started to change.

00:34:15.511 --> 00:34:16.387
What changed?

00:34:16.471 --> 00:34:18.598
Well, during similar surgeries…

00:34:19.640 --> 00:34:20.558
Uh…

00:34:21.059 --> 00:34:24.604
I mean the ones
that required general anesthesia.

00:34:25.354 --> 00:34:29.358
She couldn't seem
to hold a scalpel properly anymore.

00:34:31.652 --> 00:34:32.737
So then,

00:34:33.571 --> 00:34:34.989
she's got the yips?

00:34:35.073 --> 00:34:36.699
Most probably.

00:34:40.161 --> 00:34:41.496
So that's why

00:34:41.579 --> 00:34:43.414
she needs surgeons like us.

00:34:43.498 --> 00:34:44.624
The dark side.

00:34:49.712 --> 00:34:50.797
I see.

00:34:50.880 --> 00:34:52.298
I'd like you to leave.

00:34:53.925 --> 00:34:55.510
Regardless of your wishes,

00:34:56.094 --> 00:34:59.263
if Dr. Numata decides to resign,

00:34:59.347 --> 00:35:01.224
then I'll speak with her personally.

00:35:02.809 --> 00:35:04.644
What are you plotting?

00:35:08.815 --> 00:35:10.233
You think I'm plotting?

00:35:10.316 --> 00:35:13.945
You covered 200 million yen
and hired Fumi just like that?

00:35:19.325 --> 00:35:21.202
I want to know
what the hell you've got going on!

00:35:21.285 --> 00:35:24.372
Ma'am, please, we will speak
directly to Dr. Numata ourselves.

00:35:24.455 --> 00:35:25.623
Just shut up!

00:35:31.337 --> 00:35:35.049
Your kind think
you can buy people's lives with money,

00:35:35.133 --> 00:35:37.844
and then treat them
like they're just trash.

00:35:38.344 --> 00:35:40.054
My daughter is precious,

00:35:40.555 --> 00:35:44.809
and I refuse to let people like you
take her hostage!

00:35:45.601 --> 00:35:48.437
You can go now.
We'll speak to Dr. Numata directly.

00:35:48.521 --> 00:35:51.149
Come, ma'am. It's time to go now.
Come on, this way.

00:35:51.232 --> 00:35:53.776
-Let go of me! Get off me!
-Please calm down, ma'am.

00:35:53.860 --> 00:35:55.903
-Otherwise, we'll call the police.
-Stop!

00:35:55.987 --> 00:35:58.447
Go ahead and call them.
Give me my Fumi back!

00:35:58.531 --> 00:36:00.158
-Calm down!
-Let go of me!

00:36:00.241 --> 00:36:01.784
You're a fraud!

00:36:01.868 --> 00:36:03.286
-Give her to me!
-Stop it now!

00:36:03.369 --> 00:36:06.372
-Stop it!
-Fumi is mine! Give her back!

00:36:07.373 --> 00:36:11.127
-Give me my Fumi!
-Yes, all right. We understand.

00:36:11.210 --> 00:36:12.587
Right? All right?

00:36:12.670 --> 00:36:14.714
-Damn you.
-Come on.

00:36:14.797 --> 00:36:15.798
Get out of here.

00:36:17.216 --> 00:36:18.509
Moeno,

00:36:20.136 --> 00:36:22.388
sweetheart, this is for your own good.

00:36:22.471 --> 00:36:24.891
Yeah, well, I never asked you to do this!

00:36:24.974 --> 00:36:27.768
-I had to. It would have been too late!
-I'm not gonna do it!

00:36:27.852 --> 00:36:29.478
I'm never gonna leave Dad!

00:36:29.562 --> 00:36:32.899
When Mom was sick and dying,

00:36:32.982 --> 00:36:35.276
my dad took care of her all by himself.

00:36:35.359 --> 00:36:38.905
And then he had to raise me all alone.

00:36:38.988 --> 00:36:40.615
Do you know how hard it was for him?

00:36:40.698 --> 00:36:43.117
Do you know how much he's suffered?

00:36:43.201 --> 00:36:46.329
That doesn't mean it's okay
for him to make money off your videos.

00:36:46.412 --> 00:36:47.830
It's not something a parent--

00:36:47.914 --> 00:36:49.040
Get out!

00:36:51.125 --> 00:36:52.960
Don't say that about him!

00:36:53.044 --> 00:36:54.754
You never cared about me!

00:36:54.837 --> 00:36:58.424
Don't act like you care
all of a sudden. Get out!

00:37:01.302 --> 00:37:02.637
Get out!

00:37:11.395 --> 00:37:13.773
Don't ever come back here!

00:37:18.527 --> 00:37:21.572
Now that girl
has the director at her beck and call.

00:37:22.490 --> 00:37:26.702
And apparently, she also paid a hefty sum
to keep them quiet.

00:37:28.329 --> 00:37:31.332
If the chairman got wind of it,
it would be over for her.

00:37:33.834 --> 00:37:37.922
Well, isn't the chairman retired though?

00:37:38.756 --> 00:37:39.924
What's the big deal?

00:37:40.007 --> 00:37:42.009
That's what he wants people to think.

00:37:42.093 --> 00:37:44.595
He's a sort of the wizard
behind the curtain.

00:37:45.221 --> 00:37:46.722
You've heard of that kid?

00:37:47.223 --> 00:37:49.850
-The kid who wants to get plastic surgery?
-Yeah.

00:37:49.934 --> 00:37:52.478
They say the chairman's
pushing hard for it.

00:37:59.318 --> 00:38:00.695
DIRECTOR

00:38:05.533 --> 00:38:07.743
No. No, no. Don't worry about that.

00:38:08.828 --> 00:38:10.997
Hello. This is Dr. Numata.

00:38:11.497 --> 00:38:16.794
Don't you ever send your mother
to the clinic ever again.

00:38:18.337 --> 00:38:19.338
I'm sorry, what?

00:38:20.089 --> 00:38:21.841
My mother? What are you talking about?

00:38:21.924 --> 00:38:23.009
Grow up.

00:38:23.592 --> 00:38:24.969
You're not a kid anymore.

00:38:32.518 --> 00:38:33.477
One, two!

00:38:39.900 --> 00:38:40.943
Come with me.

00:38:43.237 --> 00:38:45.489
Why the hell
did you pull a stunt like that?

00:38:46.532 --> 00:38:48.576
What the hell's gotten into you, Fumi?

00:38:48.659 --> 00:38:49.994
You'll disturb the customers.

00:38:50.077 --> 00:38:52.788
I want you
to stop interfering with my life!

00:38:52.872 --> 00:38:54.290
Tell me the truth.

00:38:55.041 --> 00:38:58.711
Aren't you ashamed of having
people like that push you around all day?

00:38:58.794 --> 00:38:59.628
What?

00:39:00.129 --> 00:39:03.549
You've let men push you around
my whole life, and you're judging me?

00:39:03.632 --> 00:39:06.844
Remind me who's responsible
for saving this house?

00:39:08.054 --> 00:39:10.348
-Quit acting like I owe you.
-Huh?

00:39:10.431 --> 00:39:12.099
I would rather die homeless on the streets

00:39:12.183 --> 00:39:15.227
than take a single cent
from people who profit off desire!

00:39:15.311 --> 00:39:17.021
So go ahead and die!

00:39:17.104 --> 00:39:20.274
But don't you dare ruin Takeru's life!

00:39:21.567 --> 00:39:26.197
How's he gonna go to college
when you're 200 million yen in debt, huh?

00:39:26.280 --> 00:39:27.365
Answer me!

00:39:27.448 --> 00:39:29.408
You have no right to butt in
and screw it all up

00:39:29.492 --> 00:39:31.452
when you can't even do a damn thing
for my brother!

00:39:31.535 --> 00:39:33.287
Quit acting like you know
anything about it!

00:39:33.371 --> 00:39:35.081
-Shut the hell up!
-Stop it!

00:39:38.125 --> 00:39:39.126
I've had enough of this.

00:39:41.045 --> 00:39:44.006
I'm not going to go to college
if you're gonna fight all day long.

00:39:44.715 --> 00:39:46.342
Huh?

00:39:46.926 --> 00:39:48.010
Who cares if we're poor?

00:39:48.094 --> 00:39:49.762
Listen, Takeru, it's not like that.

00:39:49.845 --> 00:39:51.263
Stop lying to me!

00:39:51.347 --> 00:39:53.766
You're working at that clinic
for my sake, right?

00:39:54.433 --> 00:39:56.811
Just quit already, would you?

00:40:00.648 --> 00:40:03.859
That way, Mom will be satisfied,
and it'll all be settled.

00:40:15.037 --> 00:40:18.249
-Okay, so, your surgery starts tomorrow?
-Mm.

00:40:18.332 --> 00:40:20.418
So this is the last time
we'll see your face like this?

00:40:20.501 --> 00:40:24.213
Uh, yeah. It looks like I won't be able
to go to the pool this summer.

00:40:24.296 --> 00:40:25.881
-Oh, really?
-Mm.

00:40:25.965 --> 00:40:28.801
Oh, hey, should we all go
take photos together now.

00:40:28.884 --> 00:40:30.052
-Yeah, yeah, yeah!
-Yeah!

00:40:39.645 --> 00:40:43.357
How was it last night?
Did you have a nice time with your family?

00:40:46.777 --> 00:40:48.195
Look, I…

00:40:48.988 --> 00:40:50.531
I have nothing to do with my parents.

00:40:52.491 --> 00:40:53.701
Good to hear.

00:40:54.577 --> 00:40:57.329
It's important to be independent,
Dr. Numata.

00:40:58.664 --> 00:40:59.790
Yes, it is.

00:41:00.749 --> 00:41:03.752
It's crazy to think
that some adults over the age of 30

00:41:03.836 --> 00:41:05.588
still care about their parents' approval.

00:41:08.382 --> 00:41:09.508
Are you talking about me?

00:41:09.592 --> 00:41:11.177
Did it come across like that?

00:41:13.053 --> 00:41:14.680
I mean, I'm sure someone like you

00:41:15.806 --> 00:41:18.267
would never just do
what your parents told you to, right?

00:41:21.353 --> 00:41:23.939
Dr. Numata, your patient's here.

00:41:24.023 --> 00:41:24.940
Coming.

00:42:04.188 --> 00:42:06.482
Are you my real daddy?

00:42:07.983 --> 00:42:09.944
Why are you asking me that?

00:42:12.196 --> 00:42:14.865
Everyone is saying we don't look alike.

00:42:17.076 --> 00:42:19.787
Ah, I understand.

00:42:20.746 --> 00:42:22.873
Because they watched the TV program.

00:42:24.291 --> 00:42:25.292
Come here.

00:42:26.126 --> 00:42:26.961
Hm.

00:42:29.255 --> 00:42:30.381
Listen to me.

00:42:30.464 --> 00:42:32.508
No matter what anyone else says,

00:42:32.591 --> 00:42:34.301
you are my precious daughter.

00:42:34.802 --> 00:42:36.512
My one and only daughter, sweetheart.

00:42:37.263 --> 00:42:39.390
But then, what's actually true?

00:42:40.307 --> 00:42:41.892
The truth doesn't matter.

00:42:41.976 --> 00:42:44.436
It doesn't matter
if we don't look alike, right?

00:42:44.937 --> 00:42:47.523
Because you are
the one and only daughter I have.

00:42:49.942 --> 00:42:51.026
What?

00:42:51.110 --> 00:42:52.778
Hey, don't make that face.

00:42:52.861 --> 00:42:54.530
Smile.

00:42:55.656 --> 00:42:58.284
That's good. You know, Rin?

00:42:59.285 --> 00:43:00.869
I love that smile of yours.

00:43:01.870 --> 00:43:03.372
And when I see you smile,

00:43:03.455 --> 00:43:05.874
it energizes me, and I can work harder.

00:43:06.375 --> 00:43:07.960
So I would like you

00:43:08.460 --> 00:43:10.671
to always be smiling for Daddy.

00:43:10.754 --> 00:43:12.881
That's good.

00:43:12.965 --> 00:43:15.301
That's it.

00:43:15.384 --> 00:43:18.012
CUTE
PRINCESS POSE

00:43:23.100 --> 00:43:26.395
I was thinking about how much
you're starting to look like your mom.

00:43:40.326 --> 00:43:42.202
Hi! Let's get started.

00:43:42.286 --> 00:43:45.039
It's been really hot outside.
How are you all doing?

00:43:45.539 --> 00:43:47.666
Let's see how many viewers are with us.

00:43:48.751 --> 00:43:53.756
Wow! Almost 2,000 people
are watching this live. That's great!

00:43:56.133 --> 00:43:58.385
Ah, hello, everyone!

00:43:58.469 --> 00:44:01.055
This is the Tohyama Clinic team!

00:44:01.138 --> 00:44:02.014
Welcome!

00:44:02.097 --> 00:44:03.766
Welcome!

00:44:03.849 --> 00:44:08.896
Wow, what an amazing welcome.
Thank you so much for having me!

00:44:10.522 --> 00:44:11.815
Hi there!

00:44:11.899 --> 00:44:13.942
ARATA TOHYAMA
BUY AND SEND ¥50,000

00:44:14.026 --> 00:44:15.361
Thank you!

00:44:18.322 --> 00:44:21.533
I'm having my first surgery today,
and I'm pretty nervous,

00:44:21.617 --> 00:44:23.619
but I'm going to be brave.

00:44:23.702 --> 00:44:25.037
Everyone together now…

00:44:25.120 --> 00:44:27.331
Princess Pose!

00:44:27.414 --> 00:44:29.041
THE CHAIRMAN! IS HE WATCHING?

00:44:29.124 --> 00:44:31.377
Wow! Everyone can do it.
That's so amazing!

00:44:31.460 --> 00:44:32.378
MOENO SURGERY SCHEDULE

00:44:32.461 --> 00:44:34.338
So, the whole package, huh?

00:44:34.838 --> 00:44:39.009
-She said it's what she wanted.
-Director, Ms. Konoike's on the phone.

00:44:39.093 --> 00:44:42.262
She said it's an emergency and she wants
you to go to her house right now.

00:44:48.435 --> 00:44:50.688
What? Stop the live stream?

00:44:50.771 --> 00:44:52.856
Impossible. We already
have tons of viewers.

00:44:52.940 --> 00:44:54.441
If we cut it now, it'll kill us.

00:44:54.525 --> 00:44:56.735
An emergency patient
has just come in, I'm afraid.

00:44:56.819 --> 00:44:58.987
Can we get another doctor
to perform the surgery?

00:44:59.071 --> 00:45:01.782
-No.
-We can just focus on the hands.

00:45:01.865 --> 00:45:04.785
-What? I'm doing it?
-They can't stop the live stream.

00:45:04.868 --> 00:45:06.036
But I can't do that.

00:45:06.120 --> 00:45:08.122
Today, it's just a simple
double eyelid operation.

00:45:08.205 --> 00:45:10.874
-No, I can't do it on such short notice.
-There's no time to argue.

00:45:10.958 --> 00:45:12.960
What exactly are you afraid of?

00:45:14.420 --> 00:45:16.463
That this Konoike person

00:45:16.964 --> 00:45:18.841
is going to expose what happened?

00:45:23.846 --> 00:45:26.181
Doctors make mistakes.
It happens all the time.

00:45:26.974 --> 00:45:29.685
This is all happening because
you tried to cover it up, isn't it?

00:45:30.769 --> 00:45:32.479
Just the other day, you told me

00:45:33.147 --> 00:45:34.690
that I'm not a kid anymore.

00:45:36.024 --> 00:45:37.192
What about you?

00:45:37.276 --> 00:45:39.653
You're so worried
about your dad's approval.

00:45:41.155 --> 00:45:42.114
You know,

00:45:42.906 --> 00:45:45.784
I thought you were
a lot more independent than that.

00:46:05.345 --> 00:46:07.890
-Uh, Director--
-I'll be back as soon as I can.

00:46:07.973 --> 00:46:11.185
-Try to keep the live stream going.
-I'll have the car brought.

00:46:11.268 --> 00:46:14.438
Hi, everyone. I'm Dr. Rui.
How are you all doing?

00:46:14.521 --> 00:46:16.899
Hello to all Moeno's fans.
Nice to meet you.

00:46:16.982 --> 00:46:18.150
As a surprise,

00:46:18.233 --> 00:46:21.361
today I'm gonna do a little collab
with the Moenon Channel!

00:46:21.862 --> 00:46:24.823
Moeno and I will have a little chat
before her surgery starts.

00:46:24.907 --> 00:46:27.201
It's an honor
to do a collab with you, Dr. Rui.

00:46:27.284 --> 00:46:29.495
-Yeah?
-Oh, you're so cool!

00:46:31.538 --> 00:46:35.417
-Sara. Sorry I'm late.
-Come on in.

00:46:41.381 --> 00:46:44.468
-Alexa, turn on the lights.
-Okay.

00:46:49.556 --> 00:46:51.350
Sara, I'm sorry to say this,

00:46:51.433 --> 00:46:54.144
but I don't really have much time today.

00:46:58.148 --> 00:46:59.274
It's my neck.

00:46:59.775 --> 00:47:01.485
It's been hurting since yesterday.

00:47:03.153 --> 00:47:03.987
Your neck?

00:47:06.573 --> 00:47:08.534
Yes. I wanted you to take a look at it.

00:47:16.166 --> 00:47:18.377
I'm sorry Sara, but

00:47:18.877 --> 00:47:22.005
I've got a patient
waiting for a surgery right now.

00:47:22.089 --> 00:47:24.466
If you need a massage,
I can call one of the nurses--

00:47:24.550 --> 00:47:25.801
My eyesight was taken from me.

00:47:28.804 --> 00:47:29.888
Did you forget?

00:47:33.058 --> 00:47:35.727
I'm sorry. I'm feeling a little nervous.

00:47:35.811 --> 00:47:37.771
-Hm.
-Can I go to the restroom?

00:47:37.855 --> 00:47:40.858
Of course. It's your first surgery.
Being nervous is normal.

00:47:40.941 --> 00:47:42.901
Mm. See you in a minute.

00:47:42.985 --> 00:47:45.070
-Yeah, see you.
-Okay.

00:47:47.489 --> 00:47:51.869
Uh, okay while Moeno is away,

00:47:51.952 --> 00:47:54.580
why don't I start
answering any questions you might have.

00:48:23.191 --> 00:48:24.651
I'm sorry.

00:48:29.823 --> 00:48:30.699
Mm.

00:48:31.742 --> 00:48:32.576
Mom.

00:48:40.751 --> 00:48:42.002
I'm sorry.

00:48:52.596 --> 00:48:54.723
What exactly are you afraid of?

00:48:54.806 --> 00:48:58.143
That this Konoike person
is going to expose what happened?

00:49:01.271 --> 00:49:02.814
Sara, I'm sorry.

00:49:03.941 --> 00:49:05.984
I really have to go now.

00:49:11.698 --> 00:49:12.950
That's strange.

00:49:13.033 --> 00:49:17.371
Moeno is taking a pretty long time.
She must be very nervous.

00:49:21.750 --> 00:49:26.254
Uh, well, uh, let's see…

00:49:26.338 --> 00:49:29.007
While we're waiting for Moeno to get back,

00:49:29.091 --> 00:49:33.887
I would like to treat you all to a special
performance of Dr. Rui's juggling act!

00:49:37.766 --> 00:49:39.685
Bring Dr. Rui's things to the DC.

00:49:39.768 --> 00:49:40.727
Enough.

00:49:43.105 --> 00:49:45.649
A massage that bad won't help me anyway.

00:49:51.279 --> 00:49:52.406
I'm sorry.

00:49:54.449 --> 00:49:56.159
I'll try harder next time.

00:50:02.708 --> 00:50:04.918
Don't ever speak to me like that again,

00:50:06.461 --> 00:50:08.296
or I'll call Dubai right away.

00:50:20.308 --> 00:50:21.476
Excuse me.

00:50:41.830 --> 00:50:42.664
Hello?

00:50:44.624 --> 00:50:45.667
I understand.

00:50:47.627 --> 00:50:50.255
She's on her way now,
so bring Moenon to the O.R.

00:50:52.883 --> 00:50:54.259
WHEN'S THE OPERATION?
GIVE US MOENON

00:50:59.222 --> 00:51:00.390
It's okay.

00:51:12.194 --> 00:51:15.030
Going up. Stand clear of the doors.

00:51:17.657 --> 00:51:19.743
GOOD LUCK, MOENON
FINALLY!

00:51:19.826 --> 00:51:22.746
OH, IT'S ABOUT TO START
I CAN'T WAIT

00:51:22.829 --> 00:51:24.456
The director is coming in.

00:51:27.667 --> 00:51:29.836
I'm so sorry to keep you waiting.

00:51:30.796 --> 00:51:31.838
It's okay.

00:51:33.298 --> 00:51:34.800
I'm in your hands now.

00:51:34.883 --> 00:51:36.718
MY HEART'S IN MY MOUTH!

00:51:56.947 --> 00:51:57.823
Director?

00:51:59.574 --> 00:52:01.368
WHAT ARE HER PARENTS THINKING?

00:52:01.451 --> 00:52:03.370
THE TENSION'S THROUGH THE ROOF

00:52:18.218 --> 00:52:19.553
The surgery…

00:52:25.267 --> 00:52:26.560
…is cancelled.

00:52:26.643 --> 00:52:28.270
What?

00:52:28.353 --> 00:52:29.688
-What?
-Cancelled?

00:52:29.771 --> 00:52:31.314
No. No!

00:52:31.815 --> 00:52:34.901
What are you talking about? Are you nuts?
You just made us wait for ages!

00:52:34.985 --> 00:52:36.862
Either way, it can't happen.

00:52:38.155 --> 00:52:40.282
Our clinic can't perform surgery on her.

00:52:40.365 --> 00:52:41.533
Why not?

00:52:43.702 --> 00:52:46.496
I'm truly very sorry.

00:52:47.289 --> 00:52:50.458
No, no, no.
No, no, no. Just hang on a minute.

00:52:50.542 --> 00:52:54.171
This… This is ridiculous.
You can't just do this to us.

00:52:55.005 --> 00:52:56.673
What are we supposed to do now?

00:52:57.174 --> 00:52:59.092
We'll reach out to you very soon.

00:52:59.176 --> 00:53:01.344
Moeno's being called a scammer
on the channel right now.

00:53:01.428 --> 00:53:04.389
-It's the doctor's decision.
-Don't give us that bullshit!

00:53:04.472 --> 00:53:07.517
-I'm sorry. That was her decision.
-You gotta do something.

00:53:20.071 --> 00:53:21.531
How could you do this to me?

00:53:22.782 --> 00:53:24.034
I am truly…

00:53:26.912 --> 00:53:28.622
very, very sorry, Moeno.

00:53:28.705 --> 00:53:30.457
It's way too late for that now, you know!

00:53:36.963 --> 00:53:38.673
I know that I should have…

00:53:40.592 --> 00:53:42.135
I should have told you about it sooner.

00:53:44.346 --> 00:53:46.473
I knew at our first counseling session.

00:53:48.350 --> 00:53:49.351
But I was…

00:53:51.603 --> 00:53:53.146
I didn't trust myself.

00:53:55.273 --> 00:53:56.608
I couldn't bring myself to say it.

00:53:56.691 --> 00:53:59.986
I still don't get it.
Tell me why you can't do it!

00:54:03.031 --> 00:54:04.741
I can't do it because…

00:54:10.622 --> 00:54:12.082
…I know that

00:54:13.708 --> 00:54:16.044
you weren't doing this for yourself.

00:54:17.003 --> 00:54:19.923
I think you were trying
to get these surgeries for someone else.

00:54:23.885 --> 00:54:27.347
Do you really want me
to perform this operation?

00:54:33.687 --> 00:54:34.521
Mm.

00:54:35.772 --> 00:54:37.899
Mm.

00:54:37.983 --> 00:54:40.986
Of course I want to, Doctor, I really do!

00:54:41.486 --> 00:54:45.282
And since my dad's not here,
I'll be honest with you.

00:54:45.365 --> 00:54:48.994
My views online have been
really struggling for a bit lately.

00:54:49.077 --> 00:54:53.123
So then, when I got this offer,
I thought it was the perfect timing.

00:54:53.206 --> 00:54:55.917
It would go viral, and I'd look cuter too!

00:54:56.001 --> 00:54:58.044
It's so good! I trust you.

00:54:58.128 --> 00:54:59.754
You were so cheerful.

00:55:01.256 --> 00:55:02.882
Even though it's not a simple surgery,

00:55:03.591 --> 00:55:05.677
you were acting
like it was nothing at all.

00:55:07.595 --> 00:55:09.264
And I just got the feeling

00:55:09.347 --> 00:55:12.434
that you were trying so hard
to be good for someone else.

00:55:15.895 --> 00:55:17.105
How though?

00:55:20.567 --> 00:55:25.113
How can you talk like you understand
how I'm feeling inside?

00:55:25.947 --> 00:55:27.949
You're not me, Dr. Rin!

00:55:37.125 --> 00:55:38.209
I am though.

00:55:43.131 --> 00:55:44.716
Moeno, I am

00:55:45.884 --> 00:55:47.385
exactly like you.

00:56:27.634 --> 00:56:28.760
Hey.

00:56:28.843 --> 00:56:29.761
Hey.

00:56:29.844 --> 00:56:32.097
This might finally be it for the director.

00:56:32.180 --> 00:56:33.807
What? You think so?

00:56:33.890 --> 00:56:37.519
I mean, this was the chairman's project,
and now she's botched it all.

00:56:37.602 --> 00:56:38.978
-Ah.
-Mm.

00:56:39.479 --> 00:56:43.108
You know,
I've got to say, I feel relieved.

00:56:43.983 --> 00:56:50.281
SNACK BAR ITTENBARI

00:57:17.308 --> 00:57:18.560
Just so you know…

00:57:21.062 --> 00:57:22.355
I'm not gonna quit.

00:57:28.862 --> 00:57:31.489
And I don't expect you to understand, Mom.

00:57:33.741 --> 00:57:36.536
But from now on, I'm not gonna
interfere with your life either.

00:57:40.206 --> 00:57:41.791
Why don't we leave it at that?

00:58:08.193 --> 00:58:10.320
ESTABLISHING A CHILDREN'S CLINIC

00:58:10.403 --> 00:58:15.241
PROPOSAL ON FUTURE MANAGEMENT POLICY

00:58:30.340 --> 00:58:31.841
It's strange, isn't it,

00:58:32.342 --> 00:58:35.136
for a daughter
to disregard her father's opinion?

00:58:41.184 --> 00:58:42.310
How does it feel

00:58:42.894 --> 00:58:44.812
to have someone
bite the hand that feeds her?

00:58:50.360 --> 00:58:52.237
PROPOSAL ON FUTURE MANAGEMENT POLICY

00:59:18.972 --> 00:59:19.889
Damn it.

00:59:20.890 --> 00:59:23.268
How could she make a fool out of me?

00:59:24.394 --> 00:59:26.521
How dare she make a fool out of me?!

00:59:29.691 --> 00:59:30.942
How could she do it?

00:59:32.485 --> 00:59:34.988
Why did she do it?!

00:59:35.572 --> 00:59:36.823
Why?!

00:59:36.906 --> 00:59:38.783
Oh, damn it!

00:59:46.416 --> 00:59:48.126
It looks like the Moenon Channel

00:59:48.209 --> 00:59:52.547
is going to be starting a collaboration
project with a different clinic.

00:59:52.630 --> 00:59:54.757
Can you tell me which clinic it is?

00:59:54.841 --> 00:59:56.467
It'll be with MBC.

01:00:00.263 --> 01:00:01.598
That's it, then.

01:00:04.892 --> 01:00:06.352
If she's made peace with it,

01:00:06.853 --> 01:00:08.313
I can't do anything now.

01:00:12.233 --> 01:00:15.361
-Why don't we jump in with counselling?
-Mm. Great.

01:00:15.445 --> 01:00:16.779
So tell me, Moeno,

01:00:16.863 --> 01:00:18.740
what kind of face would you like to have?

01:00:18.823 --> 01:00:20.408
-I thought about it.
-Mm-hmm.

01:00:20.491 --> 01:00:22.785
-And I didn't mention this before…
-Mm-hmm.

01:00:22.869 --> 01:00:27.457
I thought about a face
that I'd really like to have, ideally.

01:00:27.540 --> 01:00:29.959
Oh, whose face is it?

01:00:30.668 --> 01:00:31.711
Mm.

01:00:33.838 --> 01:00:35.757
This face right here.

01:00:35.840 --> 01:00:36.966
Oh!

01:00:40.053 --> 01:00:41.346
She's very beautiful.

01:00:41.429 --> 01:00:42.639
-Isn't she?
-Mm.

01:00:42.722 --> 01:00:44.891
-Is that your mom?
-Yes, that's my mom.

01:00:44.974 --> 01:00:45.975
I can tell.

01:00:46.059 --> 01:00:47.935
-You look a lot like her.
-Really? Yay!

01:00:48.019 --> 01:00:49.437
Yeah.

01:00:49.520 --> 01:00:52.690
Tell me, what part
of your mom's face do you like most?

01:00:52.774 --> 01:00:54.150
-Her eyes.
-Oh yeah?

01:00:54.233 --> 01:00:55.860
Your eyes…

01:00:55.943 --> 01:00:57.862
What? No way!

01:01:04.661 --> 01:01:05.495
Mom?

01:01:11.542 --> 01:01:12.377
Mom?

01:01:15.797 --> 01:01:16.881
Mom?

01:01:23.179 --> 01:01:24.555
Mom?

01:01:25.181 --> 01:01:26.599
Mom!

01:01:27.850 --> 01:01:28.768
Mom!